{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a hotel where everything\u2019s turned into cubes, a square dog sets out on an adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll, bounce, and collect to break through each room in seconds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game content\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious virus has transformed the entire resort hotel \u2014<br>the buildings, the furniture, even the dogs \u2014 into cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as the square dog <i>Wanko</i>, you\u2019ll explore the hotel to find your lost family.<br>Each room is sealed, but clearing away the scattered objects with physics-based action will open the way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a floating paddle to push, hit, and roll objects around.<br>Everything moves with real physics for a simple yet refreshingly satisfying experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2909570?t=1767968777","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2909570?t=1767968777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/95573b728ecc72608559a5e49f63477a676d704f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767968777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/95573b728ecc72608559a5e49f63477a676d704f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767968777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a hotel where everything\u2019s turned into cubes, a square dog sets out on an adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll, bounce, and collect to break through each room in seconds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game content\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious virus has transformed the entire resort hotel \u2014<br>the buildings, the furniture, even the dogs \u2014 into cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as the square dog <i>Wanko</i>, you\u2019ll explore the hotel to find your lost family.<br>Each room is sealed, but clearing away the scattered objects with physics-based action will open the way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a floating paddle to push, hit, and roll objects around.<br>Everything moves with real physics for a simple yet refreshingly satisfying experience.</p>","developers":["Yamabico Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/5705c1f8bf7840e2f806e6b16f9f34add47ee341/header.jpg?t=1767968777","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2909570/318811124/603ae6d645b784cae0fc643585b20e68e9403091/1765031237/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765032883","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2909570/318811124/603ae6d645b784cae0fc643585b20e68e9403091/1765031237/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765032883","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2909570/318811124/603ae6d645b784cae0fc643585b20e68e9403091/1765031237/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765032883","id":257133423,"name":"TitleDemo2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133423/1dd11433f78ba78e4403fabd74f426de48914e9f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765032883"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2909